I'm now carefully implementing the `replace` prop on `<Navigate>` components to ensure the navigation history is managed effectively, addressing back button issues. I've strictly adhered to the instruction of removing `UpdatePassword` and its associated imports. Currently, I'm focusing on why the provided `src/App.tsx` file still leads to the "No routes matched location" error. I'm investigating how the environment interacts with the routing.


